g boy. he acts like a jerk but is very skilled too.\n\nI hope you take my request into consideration! Thank you", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@astroid03/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2036818, "client_id": 1130723, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1349fbb8/uploads/origins/848f8ba6-b8bd-4cf0-8812-a859a94cb59d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b25d6213bc876c22da2146c608520307", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1349fbb8/uploads/origins/848f8ba6-b8bd-4cf0-8812-a859a94cb59d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b25d6213bc876c22da2146c608520307, https://si.imgix.net/1349fbb8/uploads/origins/848f8ba6-b8bd-4cf0-8812-a859a94cb59d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ad55064d2e3cb9d3cb5ef6d9fa9ef55 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1349fbb8/uploads/origins/848f8ba6-b8bd-4cf0-8812-a859a94cb59d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d4912fae198df44d565bbaae3f2dcb7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1349fbb8/uploads/origins/848f8ba6-b8bd-4cf0-8812-a859a94cb59d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=26fbb03ae8308366208d9bfeb5003ba3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1349fbb8/uploads/origins/848f8ba6-b8bd-4cf0-8812-a859a94cb59d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=26fbb03ae8308366208d9bfeb5003ba3, https://si.imgix.net/1349fbb8/uploads/origins/848f8ba6-b8bd-4cf0-8812-a859a94cb59d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d43f2b914d06a9320cc8ee68223cfb41 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1349fbb8/uploads/origins/848f8ba6-b8bd-4cf0-8812-a859a94cb59d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c8b219b9a5e7947ae38843427eec51d6 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Your art is beautiful, i would like to request an illustration of my two characters to use as a computer wallpaper. Feel free to cancel if it is not acceptable.\n\n\"Ronan\" - 185cm\nHe is a killer, very cold and rude most of the time and often has a creepy aura. Wears a lot of dark colours, tech wear, tactical clothing. He has a lot of scars on his face and body.\n\n\"Boe\" - 160cm\nHe is obsessed with adrenaline, is very eccentric, outgoing and gets into fights a lot so is often injured. He wears a lot of bright or pale pastel clothing. He has a scar over his nose and lots of freckles.\n\nDespite their differences, they are lovers. \"Boe\" likes \"Ronan\" because he is dangerous and exciting, and now \"Ronan\" can't get him to leave.\nPlease draw freely, you can change their outfits as well as decide what they are doing, the background and all else.\nhttps://pin.it/1XyhCNe\n\nI apologise for the problem with the links!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/ppf6wUt", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@astroid03/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2036818, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aef38f69/uploads/origins/4908ab6c-9ba3-4a25-99cb-f74aaf1a5a93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b38007654b0f98df864b764f0b81a8e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aef38f69/uploads/origins/4908ab6c-9ba3-4a25-99cb-f74aaf1a5a93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b38007654b0f98df864b764f0b81a8e, https://si.imgix.net/aef38f69/uploads/origins/4908ab6c-9ba3-4a25-99cb-f74aaf1a5a93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6028e91e672040d55e2e9e62950a697 2x, https: